      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-crm-setup-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does CRM setup cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>Launch</b><small>1 pipeline · up to 5 users</small><em>RM3,500</em></div><div class="on"><b>Connect</b><small>2 pipelines · 15 users · 1 integration</small><em>RM7,500</em></div><div><b>Scale</b><small>4 pipelines · 30 users · 2 integrations</small><em>RM15,000</em></div></div></div></div><p>It is a one-time setup. Launch is from RM3,500 for 1 pipeline, up to 5 users and 2 simple automations. Connect is from RM7,500 for up to 2 pipelines, 15 users, 5 automations, 1 standard integration and a dashboard. Scale is from RM15,000 for up to 4 pipelines, 30 users, 10 automations, 2 integrations and reporting. Your quotation confirms the final scope.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-are-crm-licences-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Are CRM licences included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Your quotation</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div class="on"><b>CRM setup · Connect</b><small>Paid to Neeko, one-time</small><em>RM7,500</em></div><div><b>Platform licences</b><small>Paid to the platform</small><em>Extra</em></div><div><b>Data cleansing</b><small>Only if your list needs it</small><em>Quoted</em></div></div></div></div><p>No. Platform licences, messaging fees and data cleansing are extra and listed in your quotation. User counts in the packages describe how many users we configure, not paid seats. Licences are paid to the platform, so the account stays yours.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-you-move-our-existing-contacts"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can you move our existing contacts?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Import contacts</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="crim crimq"><div class="crimf"><i>CSV</i><p><b>contacts.csv</b><small>1,248 rows</small></p></div><div class="crimm"><p><span>Name</span><u></u><b>Full name</b><em>✓</em></p><p><span>Phone</span><u></u><b>Mobile</b><em>✓</em></p></div><div class="crimp"><span class="crims"><span class="b">Imported ✓ · 12 merged</span></span></div></div></div></div><p>Yes. You share your contacts as a prepared spreadsheet and we map the columns and import them. Launch includes 1 prepared CSV import, and bigger moves are scoped in your quotation. If the list needs cleaning first, such as duplicates, missing fields or mixed formats, data cleansing is quoted separately.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-can-it-connect-to-whatsapp-or-our-website"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can it connect to WhatsApp or our website?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Integrations</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-link"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq4"><div><i class="gl"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Website form</b><small>New leads into the pipeline</small><em>Standard</em></div><div><i class="wa"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wa"/></svg></i><b>WhatsApp</b><small>Messaging fees extra</small><em>Standard</em></div><div><i class="sh"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><b>Google Sheets</b><small>Existing lists and reports</small><em>Standard</em></div></div></div></div><p>Yes, as a standard integration. Connect includes 1 standard integration and Scale includes 2, for example your website form, WhatsApp or Google Sheets. Messaging fees are paid to the platform. Bigger or more complex connections are built as an API integration and quoted separately.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-do-you-train-our-team"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Do you train our team?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Training</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-team"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq7"><div><b>Launch</b><small>Live session for your team</small><em>1</em></div><div class="on"><b>Connect</b><small>Dashboard + sessions</small><em>2</em></div><div><b>Scale</b><small>Reporting + sessions</small><em>3</em></div></div></div></div><p>Yes. Every package includes live training: 1 session on Launch, a dashboard and 2 sessions on Connect, and reporting and 3 sessions on Scale. We cover adding and moving deals, logging calls and messages, and reading your reports, using your own pipeline.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-after-launch"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens after launch?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>System care</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq7"><div><b>System Care</b><small>1 system · 1.5 h</small><em>RM399</em></div><div class="on"><b>System Care Plus</b><small>Up to 3 · review · 5 h</small><em>RM999</em></div><div><b>System Priority</b><small>Up to 6 · priority · 10 h</small><em>RM1,999</em></div></div></div></div><p>Each package includes defect support: 30, 60 or 90 days to fix anything that doesn’t work as agreed. After that, System care from RM399 a month covers monitoring, bug fixes and support hours. New pipelines or features are quoted separately.</p></div></div></article>
